WEBVTT

00:04:28.476 --> 00:04:30.041
The Foundation has administrated

00:04:30.041 --> 00:04:34.721
a very generous financial aid 
and scholarship

00:04:34.721 --> 00:04:38.391
because the idea was 
to really attract the best of the best

00:04:38.391 --> 00:04:40.460
and provide them with the right education.

00:04:40.964 --> 00:04:44.674
Maybe we need to explain in two words 
a couple of elements you used mentioned.

00:04:44.674 --> 00:04:49.024
So, I remember visiting Education City 
about maybe eight years ago,

00:04:49.024 --> 00:04:51.684
and I was impressed 
by the level of ambition,

00:04:51.684 --> 00:04:54.944
of trying to create not just a university 
but a sort of ecosystem

00:04:54.944 --> 00:05:00.374
that brought schools and universities 
and research centers all together.